N00B_DIAG(LITERAL_ELEMENTS_UNDECIDED, "N00B-T1041", ERROR,
    "nothing decides the element types of a container literal",
    "A literal like `{}` or `[]` gets its element types from its contents\n"
    "or from where it is used. An empty literal that is only stored in an\n"
    "unannotated variable has neither, so its types are unknown. Declare\n"
    "the type where it is stored, as in `let counts: Dict[string, int] = {}`,\n"
    "or use the literal where its type is already known.")
N00B_DIAG(UNKNOWN_JUMP_LABEL, "N00B-N1002", ERROR,
    "`break` or `continue` names a label that does not enclose it",
